    "type": "horde",
    "difficulty": 10,
    "notes": "<h3>Normal | Horde, 2 / HP</h3>\n<p><em>A ravenous pack of hungry wolves, ready to hunt down their pray.</em><br><strong>Motives &amp; Tactics:</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Difficulty:</strong> 10 | <strong>Thresholds:</strong> 6/12 | <strong>HP:</strong> 4 | <strong>Stress:</strong> 3</p>\n<p><strong>ATK:</strong> +1 | Bite &amp; Claw: Melee | 1d10+2 phy</p>\n<hr>\n<p><strong>Experience:</strong> Sense of Smell +3</p>\n<h4>Features</h4>\n<p><strong>Horde (1d6+2) - Passive</strong>: When the Wolves have marked half or more of their HP, their standard attack deals 1d6+2 physical damage instead.</p>\n<p><strong>Frenzy - Reaction</strong>: When the Wolf Pack marks HP from an attack within Melee range, you can <strong>mark a Stress</strong> to make a standard attack against the attacker. On a hit, deal an extra 1d6 damage.</p>\n",
